<p>Multiply 92 by 8, then multiply that product by 8, and so on. List the products, indenting them successively as shown and continuing indefinitely:</p>
<pre>
		92
		 736
		  5888
		   47104
		    376832
		     3014656
		      24117248
		       192937984
		9999999...
</pre>
<p>The sum converges to a string of 9s.</p>
<p>From Archimedes&#8217; Lab&#8217;s <a href="https://www.archimedes-lab.org/numbers/Num70_200.html">Zoo of Numbers</a>.</p>
